1
00:00:00,762 --> 00:00:03,682
(Sheldon:)We accept your challenge.
Name a time and place.

2
00:00:03,848 --> 00:00:06,308
- Tomorrow, 3:00, the kinetics lab.
- Make it so.

3
00:00:06,476 --> 00:00:07,686
(Leonard:)No, don't make it so.

4
00:00:07,852 --> 00:00:11,352
(Leonard:)Barry, we can't fight you tomorrow.
Our engineer is incapacitated.

5
00:00:11,523 --> 00:00:12,813
(Kripke:)What's wrong with him?

6
00:00:12,982 --> 00:00:16,822
(Raj:)He's depressed because he's pathetic
and creepy and can't get girls.

7
00:00:17,612 --> 00:00:22,202
We're all pathetic and creepy
and can't get girls.

8
00:00:22,408 --> 00:00:24,748
That's why we fight robots.

9
00:00:26,955 --> 00:00:30,165
(Kripke:)If you're not there,
you'll be exposed to ridicule.

10
00:00:31,709 --> 00:00:35,549
(Raj:)I'm curious, what part of America
is that accent from?

11
00:00:41,094 --> 00:00:42,224
- Hey.
- Hey, you got a minute?

12
00:00:42,387 --> 00:00:44,927
(Penny:)Yeah, come on in. What's up?

13
00:00:45,098 --> 00:00:47,978
- I need you to apologize to Howard...
- Get out.

14
00:00:48,601 --> 00:00:52,651
(Leonard:)Come on. Wolowitz won't come out of his
house and we need him for a robot battle.

15
00:00:52,814 --> 00:00:54,644
(Penny:)Then have the robot go and get him.

16
00:00:54,816 --> 00:00:58,526
- The robot didn't hurt his feelings.
- His feelings needed to be hurt.

